    "catalogue_description": "After not finishing my map in time for the halloween comp i decided to go all out for a Christmas one. its a big map with big areas to run around in and will be too easy for good players, its got tight areas in the houses where all the good stuff is, don\u2019t hang around in there or your be dead, this is my first map and first time using a computer, which i hope you will think when you play it you will realize how go zombiemodding is at helping a complete noob rise up and become a mapper. i will be releasing forge lane halloween next year so all feed back will be used to finish my halloween map. cant say enough thanks to all the guys at zm for all your replies to my question and tutorials. oh by the way that is me in picture the mighty DRUGSNUGS",
